# Trust: Bastok (bastok 92): the guard xi.settings.main.ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS == 1 with the setting a boolean: Lua's
# `true == 1` is false: a level 5 char is not offered the quest, Clarion Star's own script (442). A port that reads true as
# 1 (Settings.MainNumber / Main) would offer it (434); Settings.MainEquals (quest rework P9) does not. Then 1: 434,
# declined (option 0). Recorded on Lua at 1e24f4b4^ (the parent of the commit that deleted the Lua).
lists PortBastok/Clarion_Star/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/434
char zone=PortBastok pos=81.5,7.5,-24.2 lvl=5 nation=1
setting ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS true
login
trigger Clarion_Star           # ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS true: not offered, 442
finish
setting ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1
trigger Clarion_Star           # ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1: 434
finish option=0                # declined
